---
import BaseLayout from './BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 · Craft4Fun" description="链接可能已更改，或内容还在草稿里。"><section class="missing nf-reading nf-card"><p class="nf-kicker">404</p><h1>这页还没有内容。</h1><p>链接可能已更改，或内容还在草稿里。</p><a href="/">返回首页</a></section></BaseLayout>
<style>
  .missing { margin-top:2rem; padding:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem); }
  h1 { margin:.5rem 0 .8rem; font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem); line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-.045em; }
  .missing>p:last-of-type { color:var(--nf-muted); }
  a { color:var(--nf-accent); font-weight:700; }
</style>
